<title>UK: Silentnight H1 pre-tax profits up 32 pct.</title>
<headline>Silentnight H1 pre-tax profits up 32 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>twenty six weeks to August 3</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		6.99		   vs 5.22</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.0		    vs 2.75</p>
<p> Pretax		     4.9		    vs 3.7</p>
<p> Turnover		   98.8		   vs 85.2</p>
<p> Operating result	 5.02		   vs 3.79</p>
<p> Pay date		   Jan 2</p>
<p> Div registration date  Nov 26</p>
<p>NOTE - Bed manufacturer Silentnight Holdings Plc said it expects an improved overall result in the second half of the year.  </p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
